          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This permanently deletes all imported video copies, thumbnails, and library records, and stops wallpaper playback. Your original video files won’t be affected. This cannot be undone." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This permanently deletes all imported video copies, thumbnails, and library records, and stops wallpaper playback. Your original video files won’t be affected. This cannot be undone."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "読み込んだ動画のコピー、サムネイル、ライブラリの記録をすべて完全に削除し、壁紙の再生を停止します。元の動画ファイルには影響しません。この操作は取り消せません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This permanently removes all library entries, thumbnails, and video copies stored by Loopmural, and stops wallpaper playback. Linked originals and other source files won’t be deleted. This cannot be undone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This permanently removes all library entries, thumbnails, and video copies stored by Loopmural, and stops wallpaper playback. Linked originals and other source files won’t be deleted. This cannot be undone."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "すべてのライブラリ項目、サムネイル、Loopmuralに保存された動画のコピーを完全に削除し、壁紙の再生を停止します。リンク先の元のファイルやその他のソースファイルは削除されません。この操作は取り消せません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This size includes video copies stored by Loopmural. Linked originals, thumbnails, and metadata are excluded." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This size includes video copies stored by Loopmural. Linked originals, thumbnails, and metadata are excluded."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loopmuralに保存された動画のコピーの容量です。リンク先の元のファイル、サムネイル、メタデータは含まれません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This video is unavailable. For linked videos, reconnect its drive or choose Locate File… from the video’s menu. For a missing library copy, remove it and add it again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This video is unavailable. For linked videos, reconnect its drive or choose Locate File… from the video’s menu. For a missing library copy, remove it and add it again."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "この動画は利用できません。リンクされた動画の場合はドライブを再接続するか、動画のメニューから「ファイルを指定…」を選択してください。ライブラリ内のコピーが見つからない場合は、項目を削除して再追加してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
